{"4174250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Descent", "steam_appid": 4174250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend where humanity never reached</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The stars were empty. </i><br><i>So we turned downward.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Last Descent</i>, you guide a lone exploration drone into the depths of Earth’s oceans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift through a continuous vertical world, from the sunlit surface to the silent abyss. Each layer reveals traces of humanity’s search for something more — a new home, a new beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Journey of Discovery</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate an <strong>exploration drone</strong> on its quest to reach the <strong>bottom of the sea</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with <strong>wildlife</strong> and navigate past treacherous currents via <strong>puzzles</strong> and gentle <strong>platforming</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for <strong>hidden cues</strong> and <strong>special interactions</strong> to learn more about the world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Descend where humanity never reached</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The stars were empty. </i><br><i>So we turned downward.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Last Descent</i>, you guide a lone exploration drone into the depths of Earth’s oceans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift through a continuous vertical world, from the sunlit surface to the silent abyss. Each layer reveals traces of humanity’s search for something more — a new home, a new beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Journey of Discovery</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate an <strong>exploration drone</strong> on its quest to reach the <strong>bottom of the sea</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with <strong>wildlife</strong> and navigate past treacherous currents via <strong>puzzles</strong> and gentle <strong>platforming</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for <strong>hidden cues</strong> and <strong>special interactions</strong> to learn more about the world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Guide an exploration drone on a journey into the deep ocean, in search for a new home for humanity.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic<strong>*</strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Greek<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174250/c82dd03d46aa20a75cb914df8240d183bdc3a61b/header.jpg?t=1779535887", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174250/5700c88d0110642b2a13b66fe8c3ea4ffb5ad10e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779535887", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174250/5700c88d0110642b2a13b66fe8c3ea4ffb5ad10e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779535887",